::SCORE::
** Pentatonic Canon **
~ "composer: CanonGenerator (Pentatonic Algorithmic Engine)"
~ "style: 宮調式 (Major Pentatonic)"
!= 96
?= D
<4/4>

/* Pentatonic Ground Bass Prototype (Basso Ostinato) */
Bass {
    <4*>
    | 1_ - - - | 3_ - - - |
    | 5_ - - - | 2_ - - - |
}

